   For Kubernetes, the RA verifies the ServiceAccount token and resolves it to `(cluster, namespace, serviceaccount)` pl
us node claims. For devices, it resolves `(manufacturer chain, device serial, fleet)` plus attestation freshness. This p
rincipal is the only input allowed to drive SAN selection.

2) **Policy produces identities; the requester never proposes them.**  
