## Operational Notes

- Run a formal root key ceremony; keep root offline; rotate intermediates on a fixed cadence with overlap and staged tru
st-bundle rollout.
- Treat the RA as a Tier-0 service: strict change control on policy evaluation, aggressive observability on issuance out
comes, and tight least-privilege access to signer endpoints.
- Make rotation boring: agents renew early with jitter; support dual-cert overlap; verify hot-reload paths continuously 
with canaries.
- Audit must be queryable under incident pressure: store immutable issuance artifacts and a hash-chained receipt so “who
 got what when” is answerable in minutes.
